      "subtitle": "Speed and Rotation",
      "description": [
        "Gearboxes reverse rotation direction. Large cogwheels change speed by ratio — small driving large = slower with more torque, large driving small = faster with less torque. Place cogwheels perpendicular to each other to connect parallel shafts."
